# The repository-root .gitignore excludes *.sln (a legacy rule from the Node/VS Code era).
# A .gitignore in a deeper directory takes precedence, so the solution is un-ignored here
# rather than by editing the root file, which carries unrelated uncommitted changes.
!JugaadVision.sln

# Rider / Visual Studio build artefacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.DotSettings.user

# Publish output for AppImage / tar.gz distributions
publish/
*.AppImage
*.tar.gz
